  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0). NVIDIA.
  Source: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
  Used as: sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-int8
  Changes: converted to ONNX and quantized to int8 by sherpa-onnx.
